  "text": "Dr. Laura Venner - Dogwood\nSkip to content\nDogwood\nHome\nServices\nEmergency Services\nCritical Care\nUrgent Care\nSurgery and Anesthesia\nInternal Medicine\nBehavior Services\nNeurology\nCardiology\nOncology\nDermatology\nPalliative Care\nRadiology\nAbout Dogwood\nFind Service by City\nSandy Springs, GA\nDunwoody, GA\nRoswell, GA\nOur Capabilities\nBlood Bank\nCT Scans\nDialysis\nHigh Flow Oxygen Therapy\nIn-House Laboratory\nIntensive Care Unit\nIsolation Ward\nMechanical Ventilation\nOxygen Therapy\nPain Management\nSurgical Suites\nTelemetry\nThromboelastography Service\nUltrasound Service\nMeet the Team\nEmergency\nCritical Care\nSurgery\nInternal Medicine\nBehavior Services\nNeurology\nCardiology\nOncology\nDermatology\nJoin Our Team\nVirtual Tour\nPet Owners\nBlog\nPayment Options\nVeterinarians\nOrder Brochures\nReferring Vets\nReferrals\nOnline Portal\nBlood Bank\nContact Us\nClient Contact Form\nVeterinarian Contact Form\n(404) 609-1234\nAPPOINTMENTS\nREFERRALS\nHome\nServices\nEmergency Services\nCritical Care\nUrgent Care\nSurgery and Anesthesia\nInternal Medicine\nBehavior Services\nNeurology\nCardiology\nOncology\nDermatology\nPalliative Care\nRadiology\nAbout Dogwood\nFind Service by City\nSandy Springs, GA\nDunwoody, GA\nRoswell, GA\nOur Capabilities\nBlood Bank\nCT Scans\nDialysis\nHigh Flow Oxygen Therapy\nIn-House Laboratory\nIntensive Care Unit\nIsolation Ward\nMechanical Ventilation\nOxygen Therapy\nPain Management\nSurgical Suites\nTelemetry\nThromboelastography Service\nUltrasound Service\nMeet the Team\nEmergency\nCritical Care\nSurgery\nInternal Medicine\nBehavior Services\nNeurology\nCardiology\nOncology\nDermatology\nJoin Our Team\nVirtual Tour\nPet Owners\nBlog\nPayment Options\nVeterinarians\nOrder Brochures\nReferring Vets\nReferrals\nOnline Portal\nBlood Bank\nContact Us\nClient Contact Form\nVeterinarian Contact Form\nDr. Laura Venner\nDr. Laura Venner\nOncology\nDr. Laura Venner is a veterinary medical oncologist and Diplomate candidate of the American College of Veterinary Internal Medicine. She earned her DVM at The Ohio State University and completed her medical oncology residency at the University of Florida College of Veterinary Medicine — where she was voted the Class of 2025's Small Animal Resident of the Year.\nBefore her residency, she completed a clinical trials internship at Cummings School of Veterinary Medicine at Tufts University under Dr. Cheryl London — a leader in translational veterinary oncology — and a small animal medicine and surgery internship at MSPCA Angell in Boston.\nAt Dogwood, Dr. Venner treats medical oncology patients with chemotherapy, immunotherapy, targeted small-molecule inhibitors, and electrochemotherapy, with a focus on quality of life, evidence-based care, and honest, family-centered communication.\nView All Team Members\nJoin Us!\nIf you’re looking for a workplace that values medicine, mentorship, teamwork, and personal growth, Dogwood is the place to build your future.\nAvailable Opportunities\nOpen 24 Hours\nEmergency Walk-Ins\nOpen 24 Hours\nEmergency Walk-Ins\nMARIETTA\n1234 Powers Ferry Rd.\nMarietta, GA 30067\n(404) 609-1234\nAppointments\nDUNWOODY\nOPENING OCTOBER 20th\n4500 N Shallowford Rd.\nDunwoody, GA 30338\ninfo@dogwood.vet\nDogwood Services\nEmergency Services\nCritical Care\nUrgent Care\nSurgery and Anesthesia\nInternal Medicine\nBehavior Services\nNeurology\nCardiology\nOncology\nDermatology\nPalliative Care\nRadiology\nJoin Our Email List\nWhich describes you?*\nPet Owner\nReferring Veterinarian\nInterested in Careers\nMARIETTA\n1234 Powers Ferry Rd. - Marietta, GA 30067\n(404) 609-1234 -\ninfo@dogwood.vet\nDUNWOODY\nOPENING OCTOBER 20th\n4500 N Shallowford Rd.\nDunwoody, GA 30338\nJoin Our Email List\nWhich describes you?*\nPet Owner\nReferring Veterinarian\nInterested in Careers\nTestimonials\nContact Us\nPrivacy\nAccessibility\nSitemap\nAreas Served: Atlanta & Buckhead, Sandy Springs & Dunwoody, Roswell & Alpharetta, John