              "name": "Emergency Veterinary Services",
              "url": "https://www.dogwood.vet/services/pets/pet-emergency-vet-marietta",
              "serviceType": "24/7 Emergency Veterinary Care",
              "description": "Most emergency clinics in the Atlanta area stabilize your pet and refer you elsewhere for surgery, advanced imaging, or specialist care. At Dogwood, that handoff doesn’t exist. We work as a team to take care of every patient, making sure each pet receives the best treatment option, with the goal of getting them home well as soon as possible."
