              "url": "https://www.dogwood.vet/services/pets/pet-surgery-and-anesthesia-marietta",
              "serviceType": "Veterinary Surgery",
              "description": "Specialty surgery for dogs and cats including soft tissue, orthopedic, and oncologic procedures. Built around the highest standards of anesthesia, monitoring, and recovery."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Offer",
            "itemOffered": {
              "@type": "Service",
              "@id": "https://www.dogwood.vet/services/pets/pet-internal-medicine-marietta/#service",
              "name": "Internal Medicine",
              "url": "https://www.dogwood.vet/services/pets/pet-internal-medicine-marietta",
              "serviceType": "Veterinary Internal Medicine",
              "description": "Dogwood’s internal medicine service is led by a board-certified veterinary internist and a board-eligible internal medicine doctor, with the experience and the diagnostic toolkit to reach a clear diagnosis in complex and chronic cases, and to manage that diagnosis for as long as your pet needs us."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Offer",
            "itemOffered": {
              "@type": "Service",
              "@id": "https://www.dogwood.vet/services/pets/veterinary-behavior-services-marietta/#service",
              "name": "Behavior Services",
              "url": "https://www.dogwood.vet/services/pets/veterinary-behavior-services-marietta",
              "serviceType": "Veterinary Behavior Services",
              "description": "Dogwood’s veterinary behavior service provides comprehensive veterinary behavior care for dogs and cats experiencing emotional, mental, or behavioral challenges. Veterinary behavior medicine is similar to psychiatry and behavioral medicine in humans; addressing how the brain, body, learning history, and environment work together to influence behavior."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Offer",
            "itemOffered": {
              "@type": "Service",
              "@id": "https://www.dogwood.vet/services/pets/pet-cardiology/#service",
              "name": "Cardiology",
              "url": "https://www.dogwood.vet/services/pets/pet-cardiology",
              "serviceType": "Veterinary Cardiology",
              "description": "Dogwood’s cardiology service is led by a board-certified veterinary cardiologist (ACVIM Diplomate, Cardiology), with echocardiography, ECG, Holter monitoring, and the experience to evaluate murmurs, arrhythmias, congenital defects, and heart failure in dogs and cats."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Offer",
            "itemOffered": {
              "@type": "Service",
              "@id": "https://www.dogwood.vet/services/pets/pet-oncology-marietta/#service",
              "name": "Oncology",
              "url": "https://www.dogwood.vet/services/pets/pet-oncology-marietta",
              "serviceType": "Veterinary Oncology",
              "description": "A cancer diagnosis isn’t the end. It’s the start of a plan. Atlanta’s veterinary oncology team for dogs and cats. Dogwood is the only clinic in the Atlanta area where every one of these emergency veterinary services lives under the same roof, on the same shared record, working together for your pet."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Offer",
            "itemOffered": {
              "@type": "Service",
              "@id": "https://www.dogwood.vet/services/pets/pet-palliative-pain-management/#service",
              "name": "Palliative Care",
              "url": "https://www.dogwood.vet/services/pets/pet-palliative-pain-management",
              "serviceType": "Veterinary Palliative Care and Pain Management",
              "description": "Pet palliative care focuses on comfort, pain relief, and quality of life while your pet is living with a chronic or life-limiting illness. Hospice care picks up where curative treatment leaves off, shifting the focus entirely to dignity and peace in the final stage of life. At Dogwood Veterinary Specialty and Emergency, we provide both - tailored to each pet, each family, and each stage of the journey."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Offer",
            "itemOffered": {
