              "url": "https://www.dogwood.vet/services/pets/radiology",
              "serviceType": "Veterinary Radiology",
              "description": "Dogwood Veterinary Specialty & Emergency offers Atlanta’s referral-only outpatient diagnostic ultrasound, performed by a board-certified veterinary radiologist (DACVR). We support referring veterinarians with advanced imaging, timely communication, and high-quality diagnostic interpretation - while keeping your pet’s primary veterinarian at the center of ongoing care. "
